Stake SOMA with a validator: add, remove, or list delegations

Usage: soma stake [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add     Stake SOMA with a validator
  remove  Withdraw staked SOMA from a pool. Omit `--amount` to withdraw the full stake
  list    List active stakes for an address (defaults to the active wallet)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json  Output as JSON
  -h, --help  Print help

EXAMPLES:
    soma stake add --validator 0xVAL... --amount 10
    soma stake remove --pool 0xPOOL_ID
    soma stake list
